// Anti-Tiki-Taka manager archetype — hand-authored, NOT LLM-baked.
//
// A specialist counter-tactician designed to neutralize possession-rotation
// systems. Two central midfielders man-mark opposition #6/#8 with tight
// aggression. Moderate risk appetite (0.55) — committed to the man-mark
// + counter scheme but doesn't gamble beyond it. LOW possession
// preference (0.40) — the goal is to deny the opponent their possession
// game, not to play one of our own; turnover-driven attacks are the
// primary scoring mode.
//
