//   risk_appetite:         0.55 × 2^32 = 2_362_232_012.8 → 2_362_232_013
//   possession_preference: 0.40 × 2^32 = 1_717_986_918.4 → 1_717_986_918
//
// Tactical archetype reference resolves to content/sources/archetypes/
//   anti-tiki-taka.ron  (validated at load time by ContentStore).
//
// Authored 2026-05-17 (T2-1c).

